  "Case A_s4_d300_ap800: L1\u2192L4 through the L2/L3 plane pair of the 4-layer stack, drill \u00d80.3 mm, pads \u00d80.6 mm, antipads \u00d80.8 mm, four GND vias on a 1 mm circle; port 1 excited, cell near the via varied, elsewhere at most 0.1767 mm (\u03bb/20 at 40 GHz). Reference: conformal metal at 0.025 mm. Errors up to 30 GHz: max |\u0394S11| (complex difference, in dB) and max difference of |S21|.",
